        "Description": "A contract has been issued by Kronstadt Industries. You are to eliminate CEO of rival company Quantum Leap Jason Portman and hospital director Akira Nakamura. Jason Portman has tried to convince the hospital to switch from Kronstadt tech, over to Quantum Leap tech. Kronstadt having previously been friendly with Quantum, felt betrayed by these events. Akira Nakamura is gonna be paid a large amount of money if he accepts and is able to convince owners for the switch. This makes him a target.",
